  "notes": {
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b004:l007": "Болжолу жок is rendered as immeasurable in the praise of the spyglass; the exact idiomatic force is uncertain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b004:l023": "Муңчу is rendered contextually as an afflicted person or ruler in Bukhara; the precise referent is uncertain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b006:l001": "Бил is elephant in the primary Yudakhin sense; ammunition is explicitly loaded on it.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b006:l012": "Жер ченчи is rendered as surveyor in the account of sixty Russians.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b006:l020": "David is invoked as the archetypal sacred metalworker; the line says the spyglass maker was his friend.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1419:b006:l028": "The sixty кыр describe facets or edges cut on the spyglass glass; the exact optical construction is uncertain."
  },
